#
# 🏦 Finance/Banking:
#   JPMorgan, Goldman Sachs, Morgan Stanley, Bank of America, Citi, Wells Fargo
#
# 🛒 E-commerce/Retail:
#   Amazon, Walmart, Target, Costco, Home Depot, Best Buy
#
# 💊 Healthcare/Pharma:
#   UnitedHealth, CVS, Pfizer, Johnson & Johnson, Abbott
#
# 🚗 Automotive/Manufacturing:
#   Tesla, Ford, GM, Boeing, Caterpillar, 3M
#
# Example: SEARCH_TERM="Deloitte" technology consultant analyst


# =============================================
# VISA SPONSORSHIP TIPS (FOR INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS)
# =============================================
# Many companies sponsor H1B visas. To find visa-friendly jobs:
#
# 1. Add "visa sponsorship" to search:
#    SEARCH_TERM=business analyst "visa sponsorship" entry level
#
# 2. Target large companies (more likely to sponsor)
#
# 3. Focus on cities with high H1B approvals:
#    - San Francisco, CA
#    - New York, NY
#    - Seattle, WA
#    - Chicago, IL
#
# 4. Use job boards that filter by sponsorship:
#    - myvisajobs.com
#    - h1bdata.info (research companies)


# =============================================
# CERTIFICATIONS TO BOOST YOUR PROFILE
# =============================================
# Add these to your search for relevant roles:
#
# 📊 Analytics: Tableau, Power BI, Google Analytics
# ☁️ Cloud: AWS, Azure, GCP certifications
# 📋 Project Management: PMP, Scrum Master, CAPM
# 🔐 Security: CISA, CISSP, CompTIA Security+
# 💼 Business: Six Sigma, CBAP
# 🔧 Tech Specific: SAP, Salesforce, ServiceNow
